The MIT terms above cover the source code in this repository.

The experiment outputs committed under `outputs/final_holdout_converged/` are
derived from the MovieLens 32M dataset and are redistributed under the GroupLens
usage license, which permits redistribution of the data set and transformations
of it under those same conditions. In particular the data may not be used for
commercial or revenue-bearing purposes without prior permission from a faculty
member of the GroupLens Research Project, and no endorsement by the University
of Minnesota or the GroupLens Research Group is stated or implied.

MovieLens 32M is not included in this repository and must be downloaded from
<https://grouplens.org/datasets/movielens/32m/>. Publications using it should
cite:

  F. Maxwell Harper and Joseph A. Konstan. 2015. The MovieLens Datasets:
  History and Context. ACM Transactions on Interactive Intelligent Systems
  (TiiS) 5, 4: 19:1-19:19. https://doi.org/10.1145/2827872
